OL,3,GNEWSASouthport and Nottingham attack
OL,4,Avictims demand end to data breaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople affected by some of the UK's
OL,7,Fmost high-profile tragedies have called
OL,8,Ffor stronger safeguards against NHS
OL,9,Fstaff improperly accessing confidential
OL,10,Fpatient records.
OL,12,FIn an open letter, they described the
OL,13,Fbreaches as a "flagrant abuse of power"
OL,14,Fand urged ministers and NHS leaders to
OL,15,Ftake further action.
OL,17,FMore than 30 people signed the letter,
OL,18,Fincluding survivors and families
OL,19,Faffected by the Southport and
OL,20,FNottingham attacks, as well as people
OL,21,Faffected by maternity scandals.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
