OL,3,GNEWSASouthport and Nottingham attack
OL,4,Avictims demand end to data breaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth Secretary, Yvette Cooper, has
OL,7,Fdescribed the NHS data breaches as a
OL,8,F"disgrace" and in cases where it has
OL,9,Fhappened she said she expected action
OL,10,Fto be taken. The BBC has also contacted
OL,11,FNHS England for comment.
